  "EditorMetadata": {
    "Description": "Q#14 custom-event demo (SUBSCRIBER). Instance blueprint whose OnPing Event graph subscribes to Hrot.AI.Behaviors.PingEvent: the EventEntry exposes the reflected payload fields Value (int) and Strength (float) as data-outs, each wired into its own SetVariable (LastValue, LastStrength). Authored with EXPLICIT pins so wires bind by stable id (edit-safe). At runtime BlueprintTickSystem's per-slot dispatch fires OnPing whenever a PingEvent is on the bus this frame, mirroring both fields into the two variables. Pair with CustomEventPublisherDemo.",
    "Category": "Demo",
    "Recipe": null
  }
